.TH GENETREE 1 2000-1月 "load_expression" "load_expression"
.SH NAME
load_expression \- Attach the gene expression matrix to the regulation graph, the created model is
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIload_expression(\fBgraph\fR as <generic> GeneRegulationGraph, 
\fBexpr\fR as <generic> Matrix, 
\fBconfig\fR as <generic> GeneTreeConfig = \fB<NULL>\fR, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Attach the gene expression matrix to the regulation graph, the created model is
 not trained yet.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBgraph\fB \fR\- 
 the regulation graph object that is created by the \fBload_topology\fR api.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBexpr\fB \fR\- 
 the gene expression matrix object(rows are genes, columns are samples), which
 could be loaded from a csv table file via the \fBgeneExpression::load.expr\fR api.
 the numeric values of the model training and the perturbation are all taken from
 this matrix(the ARACNE model archive stores the rank transformed vectors instead
 of the raw expression values).
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBconfig\fB \fR\- the configuration object created by the \fBmake_profile\fR api.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
the untrained [XGBoostGRN](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.GeneTree.XGBoostGRN) model object.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
geneTree
.SH FILES
.PP
biosystem.dll
.PP
